{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/38d9e70d5e8863f2615f6c279fe53531.poster.avif?t=1773338071\" width=500 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/38d9e70d5e8863f2615f6c279fe53531.webm?t=1773338071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/38d9e70d5e8863f2615f6c279fe53531.mp4?t=1773338071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>METAMORPHOSIS</strong> is a brutal 2D\u00a0pixel art horror game focused on exploration, navigate a dead world using any tools at your disposal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Aria</strong>, a nun branded a sinner, seeking absolution. Journey toward the Golden Star and reach the last paradise left in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect from the demo:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo offers a glimpse of the full game, letting you explore a minimal version of the opening area, try out a variety of weapons, find secrets and die at the hands of fearsome demons, included in the demo:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 unique weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 different items ranging from tools, equippable armors, to powerful spells casted by your faith</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 different songs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*Controller and keybinding s